<description>&lt;p&gt;ISWAP commanders were killed by the Nigerian army in Borno while the group also killed a Nigerian soldier in a separate attack. Mali announced an ex-colonel as president and denied Ukrainian support for armed groups, and Niger signed a strategic cooperation protocol with Haftar's forces and received its first fuel shipment from Algeria under military escort. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0HSAWNBVV95cUxPc3BzWlV6ZXZyZkNSbzAwSzRGTmtiNkRsUEtKVWhxNXhkaUZkRThMa2owUVU4eGVOMnNqamY1TFBaTWNCSUYxTzF0ZG1Tb1I2bFNOb01DMTByczVoMG13MFdhUDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5oT2RKWWJoT2VJVi0xcnlZWXFiMVZtUXVFUmF1VHBXTVZVRGtnQmplWU00XzZVZHJVRmVubWRGY3NEOFlZVnNCVTM5cTczc05CX21QUlg2OHRBY1p1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBmRnBNREJ3SnljQmVXTnR0Uk9xMzNyVHFic0RfTkE5dVpoeEhHWjl4Sk1yREg4ZmZFdHl4VUdzQV8tSXI1SkpzdzRaQndTaDY1RnRNVzd5VEJGajZxUTYxYXY3T094eVFu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chronicle NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOV29BbXk5S2xucm1JWV9VMUJqeF9rQ1d4OUJkODBXNXRYQzZONjZ1QkVUb1NXUTNFNVEzVXVzWjFDXzQzMmtMQzJ0QXprc2hZR1RyV3dkdUNKZGVPMTl3WHBBVDliQ1FFX29mb0dXeDh1R3ZGdU85c2NHZjhLS2dndGtFY3pUd1NZdjl4clVwbWZ5TkdYNlBiNlJERURkSzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOSVJTNGdtNXpmTFVYUkh4N0FDbGNXVHNjQzFhb2hFYm85dzAxYWEzYUZFVEs1bGVVZkFEYVBoZ2xOM29UbFkzSGpMVVRlWVBOQUd4SzVsckpIQlN0UlBILUtJZTZDU2pkVS1SaHNzMHZ5